{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re sent to an archipelago of floating islands where all plants were wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet The Alpaca Prince and help him restore the magic by reforesting the floating islands with magic plants! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Fantastic Plants</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each plant has its own beauty. Learn more about them, take care and make them grow. Water them regularly and they\u2019ll produce magic. Discover the diversity and beauty of the fantastic nature you\u2019re recreating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/preview_plants.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Bring back the magic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect mana produced by your plants. The more plants you\u2019ll plant the more magic you\u2019ll be able to restore. The more magic the isle is, the more plants you unlock. A virtuous reviving cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf43Decorate your island</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect Eden : organized or wild, colorful or monochromatic, parsimonious or abundant...By moving, rotating and growing plants, create a garden that looks like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle1.png?t=1744128232\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle2.png?t=1744128232\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle3.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Growing Idle\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the time to rest. Your plants will grow and bring back mana during your absence. You just need to water them from time to time. Serenity and patience are a fertile soil for magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on discord and instagram<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/alpignon.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428310?t=1744128232","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744128232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/33c485dde3aab587029e83733c18484e3574b3c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744128232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/33c485dde3aab587029e83733c18484e3574b3c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744128232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re sent to an archipelago of floating islands where all plants were wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet The Alpaca Prince and help him restore the magic by reforesting the floating islands with magic plants! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Fantastic Plants</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each plant has its own beauty. Learn more about them, take care and make them grow. Water them regularly and they\u2019ll produce magic. Discover the diversity and beauty of the fantastic nature you\u2019re recreating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/preview_plants.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Bring back the magic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect mana produced by your plants. The more plants you\u2019ll plant the more magic you\u2019ll be able to restore. The more magic the isle is, the more plants you unlock. A virtuous reviving cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf43Decorate your island</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect Eden : organized or wild, colorful or monochromatic, parsimonious or abundant...By moving, rotating and growing plants, create a garden that looks like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle1.png?t=1744128232\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle2.png?t=1744128232\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/isle3.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Growing Idle\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the time to rest. Your plants will grow and bring back mana during your absence. You just need to water them from time to time. Serenity and patience are a fertile soil for magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on discord and instagram<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/extras/alpignon.png?t=1744128232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Awesome Alpacas Atelier"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/header.jpg?t=1744128232","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096456,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096456/movie480.mp4?t=1743695379","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096456/movie_max.mp4?t=1743695379"},"name":"Magic Regrow Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096456/3c5114a3c4822db7bc06929d3f5543e53fa68a37/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743695379","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096456/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743695379","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096456/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743695379"}}],"name":"Magic Regrowth","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Awesome Alpacas Atelier"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/5af06165824ba48aa37e35773657b30eb0173399/ss_5af06165824ba48aa37e35773657b30eb0173399.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744128232","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/5af06165824ba48aa37e35773657b30eb0173399/ss_5af06165824ba48aa37e35773657b30eb0173399.600x338.jpg?t=1744128232"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428310/da8a31779